On Thursday, I joined @ShebCoEDC's annual award ceremony. Sheboygan County, my home county, is an economic driver for the Sixth District and the state and I am proud to represent an area with such great manufacturers, businesses, and entrepreneurs.

Congratulations to:

@3SheepsBrewing  for earning Small Business of the Year.

Iron Supports for earning Entrepreneur of the Year.

@sartoricheese for earning Economic Driver of the Year.
